{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"Ingress does nothing, **requests fail.** The site is down, somebody's monitoring fires, a user complains, and within minutes someone is looking at it. The failure announces itself.\n\nWhen a NetworkPolicy does nothing, **traffic fl"}},"session_id":"0aa5f650-2fa0-47cb-b50a-0fd37e7f3f0a","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"4258a793-c1d8-48f5-ae9a-61b28e193826"}
{"type":"stream_event","event":{"type":"content_block_delta","index":1,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"ows exactly as it did before.** `kubectl get networkpolicy` shows the object. `kubectl describe` shows the rules, correctly parsed and neatly formatted. Everything you can observe about the object says it is fine, and the observable behaviour of an"}},"session_id":"0aa5f650-2fa0-47cb-b50a-0fd37e7f3f0a","parent_tool_use_id":null,"uuid":"794f1aff-64d8-40f0-a121-6285b97dd7a0"}
